  m_functionName: 
  m_description: 'Adds an emission effect to the material using a texture map and
    color multiplier.

    This node allows artists to control glowing areas of the
    mesh, supporting both  a custom Emission Map (Texture2D) and Emission Color (HDR).
    The output can be combined with the main surface color to produce self-illuminated
    surfaces, simulating effects such as neon lights, glowing eyes, or magical objects.'
